OL,3,ASpeed camera fault may have allowed
OL,4,Adrivers to escape fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FFurther problems with the accuracy of
OL,7,Fspeed cameras on English roads have
OL,8,Fbeen uncovered which may have allowed
OL,9,Fdrivers to slip through the cracks and
OL,10,Fescape fines.
OL,12,FNational Highways discovered issues
OL,13,Fwith speed cameras last year, affecting
OL,14,F154 out of 400 cameras but, following
OL,15,Fan investigation, said it had found
OL,16,Fanother fault on units monitoring roads
OL,17,Fincluding those running between
OL,18,FHuntingdon and Cambridge.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
