OL,3,ASpeed camera fault may have allowed
OL,4,Adrivers to escape fines
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office has revoked approval
OL,7,Fthat allows footage from the cameras to
OL,8,Fbe used as evidence in legal
OL,9,Fproceedings. US firm Verra Mobility
OL,10,Foperates the cameras but National
OL,11,FHighways said it will now end the
OL,12,Fcontract.
OL,14,FRoads minister Justin Madders said: "We
OL,15,Fcan't take chances with this.
